# Ms. Marvel's trigger is on the stack above Bot1's Lightning Bolt when Bot2 exiles her with Path to Exile. The trigger still resolves
# and Bot1 still draws (the draw does not depend on her), but "Ms. Marvel gains ..." has no object to gain it: she is gone (CR 608.2b,
# 400.7) and the effect knows nothing of any new object. The Bolt, with its only target gone, does nothing.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Ms. Marvel, Kamala Khan
Lightning Bolt
Island
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains
Path to Exile
Plains x20

[Actions]
