Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Ms. Marvel, Kamala Khan.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Plains.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Ms. Marvel, Kamala Khan)
Bot1.Choose(Close mana window)
? Stack.Count = 2
Bot1.Pass
