Bot2.Hand.Path to Exile.Cast(Ms. Marvel, Kamala Khan)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Stack.Count = 0

[Expect]
Exile = Ms. Marvel, Kamala Khan
Bot1.Battlefield = Island; Mox Sapphire; Mox Jet; Mox Ruby
